{
  "name": "vynst (inwendo ERP): reminder before a booking starts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reminder before a booking starts\nTimed booking event \"Pre-Start\": the ERP calls the workflow the lead time before every booking (bookable addon data automation_pre_start_minutes, default 30 minutes).\n\nNeeds the ERP setting integration_booking_timed_events_enabled. Optionally limit to some bookables (Bookable IDs on the trigger).",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "38925d99-6684-55f4-902c-c310f6df2103",
      "name": "About this template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "autoRegister": true,
        "action": "booking_pre_start",
        "bookableFilter": ""
      },
      "id": "1b76fcda-1fed-5b52-8ed9-8638a1f84b56",
      "name": "Lead Time Starts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-inwendo-erp.inwendoErpTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#caretaker",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=In {{ $json.pre_start_minutes }} minutes: {{ $json.booking_title }} in {{ $json.bookable_name }} ({{ $json.location_name }}), {{ DateTime.fromISO($json.start).toFormat('HH:mm') }}–{{ DateTime.fromISO($json.end).toFormat('HH:mm') }}{{ $json.participants ? ', ' + $json.participants + ' participants' : '' }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "100e4f21-64db-5be0-973c-6767a0e94238",
      "name": "Remind in Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "notification",
        "operation": "send",
        "recipientType": "person",
        "recipientIds": "12,34",
        "text": "=Soon: {{ $json.booking_title }} in {{ $json.bookable_name }}",
        "longText": "=Starts at {{ DateTime.fromISO($json.start).toFormat('HH:mm') }}. Please unlock and prepare the room.",
        "channels": [
          "sendPush"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "6347975a-cbf2-564d-93af-71d169b2bd93",
      "name": "Push to Caretakers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-inwendo-erp.inwendoErp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        100
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "notes": "Set the person IDs of the caretakers, then enable",
      "notesInFlow": true
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
